  "description": {
    "raw": "Your eyes turn black and weep blood, and your teeth become\njagged fangs. You gain a bite attack (1d3 points of damage if\nyou are Small, 1d4 points of damage if you are Medium). You\ngain a +4 profane bonus on Intimidate checks and on your spell\nDCs for spells with the fear descriptor. You perceive creatures as\nif using deathwatch.",
    "search_text": "\"your eyes turn black and weep blood, and your teeth become\\njagged fangs. you gain a bite attack (1d3 points of damage if\\nyou are small, 1d4 points of damage if you are medium). you\\ngain a +4 profane bonus on intimidate checks and on your spell\\ndcs for spells with the fear descriptor. you perceive creatures as\\nif using deathwatch.\"",
